From 6e89ca0e539fbe7dffb2cc97d8154ab113bbc217 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: neatsorg <neatsorg@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:06:29 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] windows.ui, windows.storage: Add RadialController and
 StorageFile activation factory stubs.

CLIP STUDIO PAINT gets the RadialController, RadialControllerMenuItem,
RadialControllerConfiguration and StorageFile factories up front and crashes
when one is missing. IRadialControllerStatics::IsSupported reports FALSE and
every other method returns E_NOTIMPL. The classes still need to be registered
under ActivatableClassId (DllPath) in the prefix.
---
 dlls/windows.storage/Makefile.in   |   1 +
 dlls/windows.storage/main.c        |   3 +
 dlls/windows.storage/private.h     |   2 +
 dlls/windows.storage/storagefile.c | 197 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/windows.ui/Makefile.in        |   1 +
 dlls/windows.ui/main.c             |   3 +
 dlls/windows.ui/private.h          |   2 +
 dlls/windows.ui/radialcontroller.c | 262 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 8 files changed, 471 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 dlls/windows.storage/storagefile.c
 create mode 100644 dlls/windows.ui/radialcontroller.c

